  "notes": "Battery-powered 10-input mixer (from the panel drawing and specifications). Channels 1-2: XLR MIC, balanced 6.35 mm LINE IN and an unbalanced TRS insert (INS). Channels 3/4, 5/6, 7/8: XLR MIC plus a stereo line pair (L works as MONO). IN 9/10 is a stereo line pair; REC/STREAM IN/OUT are RCA. MAIN OUT is balanced TRS; MON SEND, FX SEND and PHONES are unbalanced TRS. The insert path is not modelled. DC input not listed.",
